<metadata><name>Snowlands 1068 Ridge West of Shealor Lakes</name><desc>out and back to waypoint 6. 4.8 miles round trip. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/10/1068_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
